+"""Tests for Exp 5136 receipt-backed structured reasoning pool v2.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-INFER-SOTA-032,
+SCENARIO-INFER-SOTA-032-POOL,
+SCENARIO-INFER-SOTA-032-BLOCKED.
+"""
